+    {"Remember to rest between fights and to enter unexplored terrain with full health and magic. Ideally you should retreat into areas you've already explored and cleared of monsters; resting on the edge of the explored terrain increases the chances of your rest being interrupted by wandering monsters. To rest, press <w>5</w> or <w>Shift-numpad 5</w><tiles>, or <w>click the rest button</w></tiles>.", "记得在战斗之间休息，并以满生命和满魔法进入未探索区域。理想情况下，你应该退回到已经探索并清空怪物的区域；在已探索地形边缘休息会增加被游荡怪物打断的几率。要休息，请按 <w>5</w> 或 <w>Shift-numpad 5</w><tiles>，或<w>点击休息按钮</w></tiles>。"},
+    {"\nAlso, berserking might help you not to lose so much health in the first place. To use your abilities press <w>a</w>.", "\n此外，狂暴可能有助于你一开始就不会损失那么多生命。要使用你的能力，请按 <w>a</w>。"},
