+    {"This screen shows your character's set of talents. You can gain new abilities via certain items, through religion or by way of mutations. Activation of an ability usually comes at a cost, e.g. Magic power. Press '<w>!</w>' or '<w>?</w>' to toggle between ability selection and description.", "此界面显示你角色的天赋组合。你可以通过某些物品、宗教或突变获得新能力。激活能力通常需要付出代价，例如魔法值。按 '<w>!</w>' 或 '<w>?</w>' 在能力选择与描述之间切换。"},
+    {"This screen shows the skill set of your character. The number next to the skill is your current level, the higher the better. <w>Training</w> displays training percentages. <w>Costs</w> displays relative training costs. <w>Targets</w> displays skill training targets. You can toggle which skills to train by pressing their slot letters. A <darkgrey>grey</darkgrey> skill will not be trained and ease the training of others.", "此界面显示你角色的技能组合。技能旁的数字是你当前的等级，越高越好。<w>训练</w>显示训练百分比。<w>消耗</w>显示相对训练消耗。<w>目标</w>显示技能训练目标。你可以按技能对应的字母键切换是否训练。呈<darkgrey>灰色</darkgrey>的技能不会训练，并会减轻其他技能的训练负担。"},
+    {"The training percentage (in <brown>brown</brown>) shows the relative amount of the experience gained which will be used to train each skill. It is automatically set depending on which skills you have used recently. Disabling a skill sets the training rate to 0.", "训练百分比（<brown>棕色</brown>）显示所获经验中用于训练各技能的相对比例。它会根据你近期使用的技能自动设定。禁用某技能会将其训练率设为 0。"},
+    {"The training cost (in <cyan>cyan</cyan>) shows the experience cost to raise the given skill one level, relative to the cost of raising an aptitude zero skill from level zero to level one.", "训练消耗（<cyan>青色</cyan>）显示将该技能提升一级所需的经验，相对于将天赋为零的技能从零级提升到一级的消耗。"},
+    {"Press the letter of a skill to set a training target. When the target is reached a message will appear and the training of the skill will be disabled.", "按某技能的字母键可设定训练目标。达到目标时会显示消息，并自动禁用该技能的训练。"},
+    {"This screen shows the skill set of your character. Press the letter of a skill to read its description, or press <w>?</w> again to return to the skill selection.", "此界面显示你角色的技能组合。按某技能的字母键可阅读其描述，或再按 <w>?</w> 返回技能选择。"},
+    {"then be taken to target mode with the nearest monster or previous target already targeted. You can also cycle through all hostile monsters in sight with <w>+</w> or <w>-</w>. Once you're aiming at the correct monster, simply hit <w>f</w>, <w>Enter</w> or <w>.</w> to shoot at it. If you miss, <w>", "然后会进入目标模式，并已锁定最近的怪物或上一个目标。你也可以用 <w>+</w> 或 <w>-</w> 在视野内所有敌对怪物之间循环切换。一旦瞄准正确的怪物，只需按 <w>f</w>、<w>Enter</w> 或 <w>.</w> 射击。若未命中，<w>"},
+    {"</w> fires at the same target again.", "</w> 会再次朝同一目标射击。"},
+    {"This screen shows the spells in your spell library. From here you can memorise spells by selecting them, as well as view spell descriptions, search for them, and organize them. As a conjurer, you start with five memorisable spells, and one already memorised: Magic Dart. (To view memorised spells, you can exit this menu and select <w>I</w>.)", "此界面显示你法术库中的法术。你可以在这里选择法术进行记忆，也可以查看法术描述、搜索并整理它们。作为咒术师，你起始有五个可记忆法术，其中一个已记忆：魔法飞镖。（要查看已记忆法术，可退出此菜单并选择 <w>I</w>。）"},
+    {"\n\nA spell that isn't <darkgray>grayed out</darkgray> or <lightred>forbidden</lightred> can be memorised right away by selecting it at this menu.", "\n\n未<darkgray>变灰</darkgray>或<lightred>被禁止</lightred>的法术，可在此菜单中选中并立即记忆。"},
+    {"\n\nYou cannot memorise any ", "\n\n你现在无法记忆任何 "},
