+    {"you can press <w>%</w> and choose a spell, e.g. <w>a</w> (check with <w>?</w>). For attack spells you'll ", "你可以按 <w>%</w> 并选择一个法术，例如 <w>a</w>（用 <w>?</w> 查看）。对于攻击法术，你将 "},
