+    {". You'll ", "。你将 "},
+    {"When wielded, some weapons (such as this one) offer certain abilities you can activate. ", "持握时，某些武器（例如这把）会提供你可以激活的能力。 "},
+    {"\nThis weapon offers its wearer protection from certain damage sources. For an overview of your resistances (among other things) press <w>%</w>", "\n此武器为其持有者提供对某些伤害来源的保护。要查看你的抗性总览（以及其他信息），请按 <w>%</w>"},
