+    {"Only nagas and armataurs can wear barding.", "只有纳迦和甲人马可以穿戴马铠。"},
+    {"You can wear pieces of armour with <w>%</w> and take them off again with <w>%</w>", "你可以用 <w>%</w> 穿上护甲，再用 <w>%</w> 脱下"},
+    {", or, alternatively, simply click on their tiles to perform either action", "，或者，直接点击它们的图块来执行任一操作"},
+    {"\nNote that body armour with a high encumbrance rating may hinder your ability to cast spells. Light armour such as robes and leather armour will be generally safe for any aspiring spellcaster.", "\n注意，负重等级高的身体护甲可能会妨碍你施法。长袍和皮甲等轻甲对任何有志施法者通常都是安全的。"},
+    {"\nNote that shields will hinder your ability to cast spells, until you've gained enough Shields skill to remove the penalty.", "\n注意，盾牌会妨碍你施法，直到你获得足够的盾牌技能来消除惩罚。"},
+    {"\nNote that many ranged weapons are two handed and so cannot be used with an offhand item.", "\n注意，许多远程武器是双手武器，因此无法与副手物品同时使用。"},
