+    {"like this are much more likely to be of higher ", "（像这样）很可能具有更高的 "},
+    {"enchantment or have special properties, good or bad.", "附魔，或带有特殊属性，无论好坏。"},
+    {"\n\nThis armour offers its wearer protection from certain sources. For an overview of your resistances (among other things) press <w>%</w>", "\n\n此护甲为其穿戴者提供对某些来源的保护。要查看你的抗性总览（以及其他信息），请按 <w>%</w>"},
