+    {"You can easily mark its square as dangerous to avoid accidentally entering into its field of view when using auto-explore or auto-travel. To do so, enter targeting mode with x and then press e when your cursor is hovering over the monster's grid. Doing so will mark this grid and all surrounding ones within a radius of 8 as \"excluded\" ones that explore or travel modes won't enter.", "你可以轻松将其所在格子标记为危险，以免在使用自动探索或自动旅行时意外进入其视野。要做到这一点，按 x 进入目标模式，然后将光标悬停在怪物所在格子上并按 e。这样做会将此格子及周围半径 8 以内的所有格子标记为“排除”，探索或旅行模式不会进入。"},
+    {"This screen shows the skill set of your character. The number next to the skill is your current level, the higher the better. Training displays training percentages. Costs displays relative training costs. Targets displays skill training targets. You can toggle which skills to train by pressing their slot letters. A grey skill will not be trained and ease the training of others.", "此界面显示你角色的技能组合。技能旁的数字是你当前的等级，越高越好。训练显示训练百分比。消耗显示相对训练消耗。目标显示技能训练目标。你可以按技能对应的字母键切换是否训练。呈灰色的技能不会训练，并会减轻其他技能的训练负担。"},
+    {"Remember to rest between fights and to enter unexplored terrain with full health and magic. Ideally you should retreat into areas you've already explored and cleared of monsters; resting on the edge of the explored terrain increases the chances of your rest being interrupted by wandering monsters. To rest, press 5 or Shift-numpad 5, or click the rest button.", "记得在战斗之间休息，并以满生命和满魔法进入未探索区域。理想情况下，你应该退回到已经探索并清空怪物的区域；在已探索地形边缘休息会增加被游荡怪物打断的几率。要休息，请按 5 或 Shift-numpad 5，或点击休息按钮。"},
+    {"You can enter the previous (shallower) level by following these up (<<). This is ideal for retreating or finding a safe resting spot, since the previous level will have less monsters, and monsters on this level can't follow you up unless they're standing right next to you. To get back to this level again, press > while standing on the downstairs.", "你可以沿着这些楼梯向上（<<）进入上一层（更浅）。这非常适合撤退或寻找安全的休息点，因为上一层的怪物更少，而本层的怪物除非紧挨着你，否则无法跟随你上楼。要返回本层，站在下行楼梯上按 >。"},
