+    {"This screen shows the spells in your spell library. From here you can memorise spells by selecting them, as well as view spell descriptions, search for them, and organize them. As a conjurer, you start with five memorisable spells, and one already memorised: Magic Dart. (To view memorised spells, you can exit this menu and select I.)", "此界面显示你法术库中的法术。你可以在这里选择法术进行记忆，也可以查看法术描述、搜索并整理它们。作为咒术师，你起始有五个可记忆法术，其中一个已记忆：魔法飞镖。（要查看已记忆法术，可退出此菜单并选择 I。）"},
+    {"To avoid accidentally opening a door you'd rather remain closed during travel or autoexplore, you can mark it with an exclusion from the map view (X) with ee while your cursor is on the grid in question. Such an exclusion will prevent autotravel from ever entering that grid until you remove the exclusion with another press of Xe.", "为避免在自动旅行或自动探索时意外打开你宁愿保持关闭的门，你可以在光标位于该格时，在地图视图（X）中用 ee 将其标记为排除区。此类排除区会阻止自动旅行进入该格，直到你再次按 Xe 移除排除。"},
