+    {"This screen shows your character's set of talents. You can gain new abilities via certain items, through religion or by way of mutations. Activation of an ability usually comes at a cost, e.g. Magic power. Press '!' or '?' to toggle between ability selection and description.", "此界面显示你角色的天赋组合。你可以通过某些物品、宗教或突变获得新能力。激活能力通常需要付出代价，例如魔法值。按 '!' 或 '?' 在能力选择与描述之间切换。"},
+    {"you can left mouse click on the monster you wish to target (or on your player character to cast a spell on yourself) while pressing the Control key, and then select a spell from the menu. Or you can switch to the spellcasting display by clicking on the corresponding tab.", "你可以在按住 Control 键的同时，鼠标左键点击你想瞄准的怪物（或点击你的角色以对自己施法），然后从菜单中选择一个法术。或者你可以点击相应的标签页切换到施法显示。"},
+    {"*Victory:  When the wearer kills a threatening monster, it has a chance to gain +1 AC, +1 Slay, and +1 Int, capping at +7. When the wearer uses a scroll or a potion with a hostile monster in sight, its bonuses reset to +0. Unequipping it also resets its bonuses to +0.", "*胜利：  当穿戴者杀死有威胁的怪物时，它有机会获得 +1 AC、+1 斩杀和 +1 智力，上限为 +7。当穿戴者在有敌意怪物在视野内时使用卷轴或药水，其加值重置为 +0。卸下它也会将其加值重置为 +0。"},
+    {"just excommunicated you for running out of piety (your divine favour went to nothing). Maybe you repeatedly violated the religious rules, or maybe you failed to please your deity often enough, or some combination of the two. If you can find an altar dedicated to", "因你的虔诚耗尽（你的神恩已归零）而将你逐出教会。也许你屡次违反教规，也许你未能足够频繁地取悦你的神，或者两者兼有。如果你能找到一座供奉"},
+    {"= skyshark / anaconda / manticore / wolf spider /                       alligator / dire elephant / catoblepas / mountainshell /                       anaconda zombie w:5 / wolf spider zombie w:5 /                       skyshark zombie w:5 / alligator zombie w:5", "= 天鲨 / 森蚺 / 蝎狮 / 狼蛛 /                       短吻鳄 / 凶暴大象 / 卡托布莱帕斯 / 山甲龟 /                       森蚺丧尸 w:5 / 狼蛛丧尸 w:5 /                       天鲨丧尸 w:5 / 短吻鳄丧尸 w:5"},
+    {"then be taken to target mode with the nearest monster or previous target already targeted. You can also cycle through all hostile monsters in sight with + or -. Once you're aiming at the correct monster, simply hit f, Enter or . to shoot at it. If you miss,", "然后会进入目标模式，并已锁定最近的怪物或上一个目标。你也可以用 + 或 - 在视野内所有敌对怪物之间循环切换。一旦瞄准正确的怪物，只需按 f、Enter 或 . 射击。若未命中，"},
+    {"= vault warden / war gargoyle / titan / iron dragon /                       quicksilver dragon / undying armoury /                       deep elf death mage / deep elf elementalist /                       deep elf blademaster / deep elf master archer", "= 金库看守 / 战争石像鬼 / 泰坦 / 铁龙 /                       水银龙 / 不灭武库 /                       深精灵死灵法师 / 深精灵元素师 /                       深精灵剑术大师 / 深精灵神射手"},
+    {"probably won't like it if you switch allegiance. If you want to take the risk, you can convert here by pressing > while standing on the altar. Doing so will enter you into service of a random god, who will grant you some additional piety in thanks.", "很可能不喜欢你改变效忠对象。如果你想冒险，可以站在祭坛上按 > 在此皈依。这样做会让你进入某位随机神的服务，作为感谢，他会赐予你一些额外的虔诚。"},
+    {"The training percentage (in brown) shows the relative amount of the experience gained which will be used to train each skill. It is automatically set depending on which skills you have used recently. Disabling a skill sets the training rate to 0.", "训练百分比（棕色）显示所获经验中用于训练各技能的相对比例。它会根据你近期使用的技能自动设定。禁用某技能会将其训练率设为 0。"},
+    {"This particular altar is so ancient that you cannot make out which god it is dedicated to! Converting here by pressing > while standing on the altar will enter you into service of a random god, who will grant you some additional piety in thanks.", "这座祭坛太过古老，你无法辨认它供奉的是哪位神！站在祭坛上按 > 皈依，会让你进入某位随机神的服务，作为感谢，他会赐予你一些额外的虔诚。"},
