+    {"If this monster is a \"program bug\", then it's recommended that you save your game and reload. Please report monsters who masquerade as program bugs or run around the dungeon without a proper description to the authorities.", "如果此怪物是一个“程序错误”，建议你保存游戏并重新载入。请向有关方面报告那些伪装成程序错误、或在没有正当描述的情况下四处游荡的怪物。"},
+    {"This is your chance to join a religion! In general, the gods will help their followers, bestowing powers of all sorts upon them, but many of them demand a life of dedication, constant tributes or entertainment in return.", "这是你加入宗教的机会！一般来说，神祇会帮助其信徒，赐予他们各种力量，但许多神祇要求以奉献、不断献祭或取悦作为回报。"},
